{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":100149,"Title":"liked a post you made in Beach Palace Cancun Brides","Message":"Hello!\n\nstephygirl just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@stephygirl  Congrats on being a Mrs! I hope you post a wedding review and photos! I hope your wedding was everything you hoped for and more!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/63613-beach-palace-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1899837\n","Sender":{"Id":283264,"Name":"stephygirl","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283264.jpg?_r=1432750548","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436556870,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":100116,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that dandi76 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79372-wedding-weekend-activities\/?view=findpost&p=1900183\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" Thanks for the suggestions!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282697,"Name":"dandi76","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282697.jpg?_r=1436371862","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436544686,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":100115,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wedding Weekend Activities","Message":"Hello!\n\ndandi76 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThere have been a few discussions around the site about this and it seems that a lot of the ladies are saying that guests don't seem to expect you to occupy their time. It's their vacation too after all. Having said that, it doesn't hurt to have a couple of things organized but definitely make...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79372-wedding-weekend-activities\/?view=findpost&p=1900179\n","Sender":{"Id":282697,"Name":"dandi76","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282697.jpg?_r=1436371862","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436544648,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":100108,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nyycbride2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@TinkerSofi  @yycbride2016  Thank you both of you. I'm anxious to see how they turn out. I'm thing fuchsia chair bows and turquoise table runner. @  has been a huge help with my colours. I just Doug won't like pink on the table so I think it's the only way to go. I just don't want to...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1900176\n","Sender":{"Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436539375,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":100100,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"acw271011,\n\nMrsCtoB has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Valentin\".\n\nMrsCtoB said:\n======================================================================\nYes! We are very excited. We wanted to go back for our anniversary but between work schedules, it wasn't jiving. So we thought about October (that's when we went in 2013) and everything lined up perfectly. We'll be staying the 24th-31st but I know you depart on the 25th! If we run into each other, drinks are on me. \ud83d\ude01\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10080&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436537760,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10080},{"Id":100096,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"acw271011,\n\nMrsCtoB has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Valentin\".\n\nMrsCtoB said:\n======================================================================\nWe just booked last night! We arrive on the 24th. \ud83d\ude01\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10080&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436535892,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10080},{"Id":100084,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that yycbride2016 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1900168\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\"\nAh! I thought I was following your thread! How could I not be!? Crazy! Any ways, I'm updated on it all now since the last time I read through. I love the starfish craft you did! It gives me some great ideas. I'm going to start making my chair hangers this weekend\/ next week, and I was just thinking of hot glue gunning them to my tassle things but the broach seems like a great idea! And like I've said before, I'm so happy you got your dress! Its absolutely gorgeous!!! The keyhole back is absolutely amazing. I had considered doing a dress like that but I didnt like the idea of straps. I think you will look stunning on your special day! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436532466,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":100079,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nyycbride2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOk ladies. So I decided to try and be crafty and I'm so proud of myself!!! I've already said that I must have been in the bathroom when God handed out the creativity genes - I don't have a creative bone in my body. But boy oh boy, I'm learning! So here is a product of my handiwork! I got the i...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1899801\n","Sender":{"Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436532282,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":100076,"Title":"liked a post you made in Resort Selection","Message":"Hello!\n\nmlklovestory716 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHi and welcome! There is a whole section on resort reviews as well as current threads that you could spend some time reading. Just do a search up top for what you want and the threads will come up. Choosing your resort is probably the most stressful part of planning and if you already hav...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79367-resort-selection\/?view=findpost&p=1900110\n","Sender":{"Id":283178,"Name":"mlklovestory716","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436532090,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":100074,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nyycbride2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWell drum roll please!! Done deal! I said yes to the dress!! (lmao that's so corny!!) Here it is:\n \n \n \nThe back\n \n \n \nAnd up close\n \n \n \nFinally!! It's off the to do list!!\n \n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1899241\n","Sender":{"Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436532044,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99975,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that vancouverpetunia mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79368-looking-for-a-small-all-inclusive\/?view=findpost&p=1900147\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"TraceyT\" We are having our wedding at Now Sapphire and did a quick site visit in the spring. It seems relatively small if you get a room close to the pools\/restaurants. It's about 500 rooms, though, so not tiny. We didn't stay there, however, so don't have a really good idea of the property. I have stayed at the Fairmont Mayakoba (Mayakoba complex was suggested by @\"acw271011\" - there are about 3 - 4 hotels there). The Fairmont is VERY spread out and you have to pay big bucks to stay near the beach. They do have trams running frequently and also have bikes available, but they are not the greatest and may not work for your ankle. It is a beautiful property, although not cheap (not all-inclusive). Have not been to the other resorts at Mayakoba. Dreams Tulum is nice, and if you get a room close to the beach\/pool it is convenient. I stayed in the \"cheap seats\" - furthest building - and it was a good 10 min walk. Don't remember any trams.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436491194,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99851,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that calgarybride2015 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79361-personal-item-on-plane\/?view=findpost&p=1900109\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\"   Ok I wasn't one of those! haha!    Generally when I travel I only have a back pack with my ipad, camera, purse and maybe a magazine & a snack. I usually check everything else.     For the wedding I brought as much on the plane as I could while being reasonable!  \n \nNext month when we go to Vegas in economy and have to pay for a checked bag, I am going to hate it HAHHA!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1436450623,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99790,"Title":"liked a post you made in Meandhim - Grand Palladium...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWow - the fact that you're doing a countdown like that and I'm just a couple of weeks before you? Yikes! Thank goodness it isn't our wedding... otherwise I'd be really freaking out! lol  My only glitch - we still don't know where we're staying! I think the decision is made \"in mind\" but w...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1900064\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436438478,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99758,"Title":"liked a post you made in Personal Item On Plane","Message":"Hello!\n\nMissFrench just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nNot sure if you're in the US or canada, but the latest is that in canada they are now enforcing the size limits for carry ons. There is a \"guide\" at the check in area and if your bag doesn't fit the guide, they will force you to check it. My sister is a terminal supervisor at Pearson and she s...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79361-personal-item-on-plane\/?view=findpost&p=1900061\n","Sender":{"Id":280992,"Name":"MissFrench","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280992.jpg?_r=1421507914","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436412034,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99755,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that MissFrench mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79361-personal-item-on-plane\/?view=findpost&p=1900076\n\n----------------------------------\nThanks ladies!  I agree with @\"acw271011\", Kim you are a smart traveler!  We're flying out of the US and after a little more searching I found the following (personal items are to be stored under the seat so I think I'll be ok according to these measurements!)\n \n \n Carry-on Baggage Size Restrictions\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEach customer may bring onboard one personal item (purse, briefcase, laptop, etc.) which must fit under the seat, plus one carry-on bag which must be stowed in the overhead bin. Dimensions are as follows:\nOverhead: \t\t\t\tIn order to fit in the overhead bin, your carry-on bag must not exceed 22\" L (55.88 cm) x 14\" W (35.56 cm) x 9\" H (22.86 cm) on all of our aircraft types\t\t\t\tUnder the seat: \t\t\t\tAirbus A321: 17 inches (43.2 centimeters) length x 13 inches (33 centimeters) width x 11 inches (27.9 centimeters) height\t\t\t\tA320 \/ E190: 18 inches (45.72 cm) length x 15 inches (38.1 cm) width x 8 inches (20.32 cm) height\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":280992,"Name":"MissFrench","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280992.jpg?_r=1421507914","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436411995,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99640,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that snswedding2016 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1900037\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" @\"yycbride2016\" @\"TinkerSofi\" Thanks ladies! The light blue is my favourite too - my maids of honour are going to be in that colour (capri -at David's) and the other girls will be in varying shades of blue.\n \nWhen we took our flower girl shopping to try on the dress for sizing, I was worried she was going to put up a fight. This girl loves comfort put her in socks and sweats any day! haha! Well she saw the dress and said she thought it looked like an \"Elsa Dress\" - Frozen is one of her many obsessions right now. I knew I picked the right dress when she got excited to dress up like \"Elsa\".  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>\n \nI was looking over our budget last night and going over the wedding fund - as of right now with the budget we created, we can pay it all off! I'm super excited about this! I still want to put money aside for misc costs because those will always come up and hopefully I don't add too many things now that I know we can afford it. haha. I'm just happy to not be too stressed about all this. What really helped us was last year I was putting away WAY more money than I needed to for taxes and I inadvertently started a wedding fund.  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436369722,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99587,"Title":"liked a post you made in Snswedding2016 Planning Thr...","Message":"Hello!\n\nyycbride2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWow - U2 tickets??? Can't say no to that deal!! Nice that FI was able to put it together to go.\n \nLove the little girl dresses. Been there done that! lol With 4 granddaughters...... well, now you get the idea! lol\n \nI love your colour palette! Blue is my favou...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1900010\n","Sender":{"Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436362874,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99583,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that yycbride2016 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79227-yycbride2016-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-february-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1900015\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" Thanks! I will keep them in mind for sure! Yup its Ethos Bridal in West Edmonton Mall.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436362586,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99579,"Title":"liked a post you made in Yycbride2016 Grand Sirenis...","Message":"Hello!\n\nyycbride2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThere's always the www.preownedweddingdresses.com (http:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com) website for veils too if you want to have a look there. Can you tell me the name of the store in Edmonton? Thanks!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79227-yycbride2016-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-february-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1900006\n","Sender":{"Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436362559,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99470,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that abeautyandthebusiness mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79355-just-joined-soon-to-be-a-jellyfish-bride\/?view=findpost&p=1899973\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" and @\"perianjay\" and @\"Moments That Matter\"\n \nThank you for the welcome! I have been going back and looking and there is so much information! I am so glad out photographer suggested this site to us! I do have to say We don't really have much to do for now other than worry about a resort. We just want to book everything now to guarantee we have the venders we want for our wedding! \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":283847,"Name":"abeautyandthebusiness","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283847.jpg?_r=1436278737","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436309507,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99438,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that calgarybride2015 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79354-what-to-do-with-all-of-your-wedding-supplies\/?view=findpost&p=1899961\n\n----------------------------------\nI brought all our items myself but I know a lot of brides who ask friends and family to help. Our airline gave us a free upgrade to first class so for my family of 4 we in total had 6 suitcases (some up to 70lbs but no way I could make one that heavy).  Also know what your carry on limits are and stretch them. Ours said a suitcase and personal item - soooo I used a suitcase and large weekender bag for each of us lol. In total with my dress we had 11 bags. \n\nI brought all Breakables and important items in carry on - dress, jewelry, under clothes for dress and shoes, etc.  All the decor and OOT items were checked.  I brought the maracas in carry too cause we had room. \n\nIn the end I had 3 for wedding and 3 for clothes basically.  \n\nAlso as said above, on the way home you'd think I'd have half the amount but didn't. Was only less one suitcase as honestly dirty clothes take a lot of room lol\n\nI left most my wedding decor items for the resort to re use. \n\n@\"acw271011\" had a lot of good info on how to pack, what to prepare for in customs, etc so I won't repeat all that. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1436299230,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99399,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that stephygirl mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/63613-beach-palace-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1899947\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" - Thank you!  I will definitely be posting a wedding review in the near future.  The wedding was a total dream...I want to do it again and again!  I miss Cancun...\n \n@\"jj575757\" - We chose the Italian buffet for the reception dinner.  It was pretty decent.  My (SUPER PICKY) husband liked the lasagna, and our guests liked the chicken and fish.  The desserts were underwhelming.  For the wedding day, we had the BBQ buffet. The BBQ chicken was GREAT, the shrimp kebabs were pretty good, the pork ribs were okay, and the fruit salad was lovely.  I definitely liked the BBQ buffet better than the Italian.  I wouldn't recommend doing a Mexican buffet.  Your guests will be having enough Mexican-themed food during their stay.\n \nOur cake was a round chocolate cake with vanilla chantilly frosting - and it was seriously the best wedding cake I've ever had. I normally don't even like cake that much.  When you get married there please cut off a few pieces and refrigerated-mail them to me  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/>.  \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":283264,"Name":"stephygirl","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283264.jpg?_r=1432750548","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436284731,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99290,"Title":"liked a post you made in What To Do With All Of Your...","Message":"Hello!\n\nRivieraBride15 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nYou're not alone with the question of getting all of your d\u00e9cor items to your destination. The resorts very strongly advise against shipping anything to them. It can very easily get lost for starters, and if it gets to the wrong person at the resort, it could end up anywhere. Courier isn't the...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79354-what-to-do-with-all-of-your-wedding-supplies\/?view=findpost&p=1899916\n","Sender":{"Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436268597,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99269,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1899910\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" You ladies sure know how to make a girl feel good! You're all so sweet. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436263343,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99265,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"Wafflesmom\" data-cid=\"1899893\" data-time=\"1436241902\">@  I'm gonna say it again because it warrants a lot of compliments.....I love your engagement photos!!! You and Chester look so in love and you can really see that in these photos. I love the...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1899902\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436263317,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99243,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"TinkerSofi\" data-cid=\"1899890\" data-time=\"1436241394\">We ended up going with Tamara Jones and we're getting married July 7th, so pretty much in exactly one month! In hindsight we probably could have gone with someone a bit cheaper but my mom was...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1899903\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1436258819,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99089,"Title":"liked a post you made in Bridal Coach!","Message":"Hello!\n\ndreamweddings just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  Thanks Joyce!\n \nGood luck with the \"Bridal Couch!\" You've definitely helped keep me sane!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79347-bridal-coach\/?view=findpost&p=1899803\n","Sender":{"Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436196453,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99041,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nsnswedding2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOk ladies. So I decided to try and be crafty and I'm so proud of myself!!! I've already said that I must have been in the bathroom when God handed out the creativity genes - I don't have a creative bone in my body. But boy oh boy, I'm learning! So here is a product of my handiwork! I got the i...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1899801\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436181360,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99034,"Title":"liked a post you made in Barcelo Maya Dw","Message":"Hello!\n\nsnswedding2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@snswedding2016  Well done! That's a fantastic answer!  @KirstenChrisDW2016  Our bride to be is absolutely correct with the info she gave you! The first recommendation is always if you don't have a TA, definitely look into working with one! They will become your new BF...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79349-barcelo-maya-dw\/?view=findpost&p=1899833\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436180071,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":99030,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that yycbride2016 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79227-yycbride2016-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-february-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1899848\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" Yup thats the one! The sale goes until August 31 so I imagine the deals will get better as time goes on!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436179455,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"474","TotalPages":16,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":450},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
